TextView.android:text:
DMarket Alert is a mobile application for monitoring targets on the DMarket platform.
 The application helps the user to monitor price changes for the targets he has set and receive instant notifications about any changes.

 The use of DMarket data is carried out exclusively for educational and personal purposes.
 Our team is not DMarket employees, and all trading operations take place directly on the DMarket platform.
 We do not influence the operation of the market and do not change the platform data.

 Application functionality:
 - Monitoring of the user's active targets;
 - History of all set targets and their changes;
 - List of notifications about new prices and broken targets;
 - Settings of notifications and personal settings;
 - User profile with personal data.

 License and rights:
 - All code of the DMarketAlert application is developed by our team and licensed under the MIT License;
 - Use of the DMarket API is carried out within the limits of permission for educational and personal use;
 - All rights to the data provided by DMarket remain with the platform.

 Contact information:
 - Developers: JozyMont and joalausi
 - Email: dmarketalert.team@gmail.com
 - GitHub: https://github.com/joalausl/dm-tradebot

 Thank you for using MarketAlerti! We are always happy to receive your feedback and suggestions for improving the application.
